08:24.260 --> 08:28.600
it can build a website, and it can analyze data, right?

08:28.600 --> 08:30.640
Among many other things.

08:30.640 --> 08:32.540
And it's called Python

08:32.540 --> 08:34.100
because some nerds decided to call it that

08:34.100 --> 08:35.020
about 30 years ago,

08:35.020 --> 08:36.580
because they really liked Monty Python.

08:36.580 --> 08:37.700
