25:22.080 --> 25:23.800
over and over again as you go.

25:23.800 --> 25:25.800
And the Jupyter cells, once you define something

25:25.800 --> 25:29.220
in one cell, it's reusable in another cell, right?

25:29.220 --> 25:31.380
So here's a very simple example where I've decided

25:31.380 --> 25:33.380
